(5396158, 774319, 66616, '<td valign="top">Compositionally the bridge leads my eyes off the image and the bridge seems to cut the picture in half. Nice light and Tones.</td>', 'Compositionally the bridge leads my eyes off the image and the bridge seems to cut the picture in half. Nice light and Tones.', '2009-03-23 05:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5396167, 775679, 52472, '<td valign="top">The black background works very well with the yellow flower and I love how the stem fades into it, you have a lovely lighting. I wonder why you did not stick with the 3:2 format and crop a bit left and right, it would fill the frame more and keep the tall/slender look. A tad sharper and it would perfect in my eyes.</td>', 'The black background works very well with the yellow flower and I love how the stem fades into it, you have a lovely lighting. I wonder why you did not stick with the 3:2 format and crop a bit left and right, it would fill the frame more and keep the tall/slender look. A tad sharper and it would perfect in my eyes.', '2009-03-23 05:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5396173, 775021, 52472, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and great use of motion blur. The fact that it''s not immediately clear how many subjects there are, makes the shot very interesting to look at for a long time. That''s the main quality of a great picture!</td>', 'Nice perspective and great use of motion blur. The fact that it''s not immediately clear how many subjects there are, makes the shot very interesting to look at for a long time. That''s the main quality of a great picture!', '2009-03-23 05:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
