(5396567, 774992, 79720, '<td valign="top">Well, there is some room for improvement here. It looks like you might have had more luck if you''d stopped the car and used a tripod. At least you could have straightened the horizon in post. :-)</td>', 'Well, there is some room for improvement here. It looks like you might have had more luck if you''d stopped the car and used a tripod. At least you could have straightened the horizon in post. :-)', '2009-03-23 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
