(5396605, 774871, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fisheye presentation is inspired. Clarity, contrast, composition all work great to create this pleasant scene I want to linger on.</td>', 'Fisheye presentation is inspired. Clarity, contrast, composition all work great to create this pleasant scene I want to linger on.', '2009-03-23 12:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
