(5396610, 775082, 18197, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the sort of image I tend to like but this one seems to work so well. The mist/steam/cloud stuff is terrific giving it a dynamic feel.</td>', 'This isn''t the sort of image I tend to like but this one seems to work so well. The mist/steam/cloud stuff is terrific giving it a dynamic feel.', '2009-03-23 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
