(5396653, 775377, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t get too wet!  The camera placement certainly gives the feeling of being mid stream, and of the power of the water rushing passed the viewer.  An effective use of technique, good exposure and composition  - works for me!</td>', 'Hope you didn''t get too wet!  The camera placement certainly gives the feeling of being mid stream, and of the power of the water rushing passed the viewer.  An effective use of technique, good exposure and composition  - works for me!', '2009-03-23 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
