(5397914, 775103, 67258, '<td valign="top">Back to comment - easily my favourite of the challenge, and one of only two 10s I gave.The streak of the bus is really interesting - little more than a streak of colour, and yet it siomehow retains sufficient form to be immediately clear.  Sometimes, more often than not perhaps, this style of processing can look a little contrived, rather twee, but here it works for me.</td>', 'Back to comment - easily my favourite of the challenge, and one of only two 10s I gave.The streak of the bus is really interesting - little more than a streak of colour, and yet it siomehow retains sufficient form to be immediately clear.  Sometimes, more often than not perhaps, this style of processing can look a little contrived, rather twee, but here it works for me.', '2009-03-24 08:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5397915, 775717, 67258, '<td valign="top">This photo has actually made me cry.  I am sitting viewing it with tears pouring down my cheeks.  Thank you.<br/>Edit, I am now viewing this on my horrible work monitor - I can not make out the face at all!  No change to my vote of 10, as I only ever vote based on my home monitor.</td>', 'This photo has actually made me cry.  I am sitting viewing it with tears pouring down my cheeks.  Thank you.Edit, I am now viewing this on my horrible work monitor - I can not make out the face at all!  No change to my vote of 10, as I only ever vote based on my home monitor.', '2009-03-24 08:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5397919, 775277, 79816, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or do you see the crocodile as well? Blockout the right hand cliff and it looks like a big crocodile breaching the surface!</td>', 'Is it just me, or do you see the crocodile as well? Blockout the right hand cliff and it looks like a big crocodile breaching the surface!', '2009-03-24 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5398002, 775015, 101678, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  10 from me. Love the strong lines and excellent control of the light.  Just enough to allow the posts to be exposed but still give the darkening feel of the sunset.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  10 from me. Love the strong lines and excellent control of the light.  Just enough to allow the posts to be exposed but still give the darkening feel of the sunset.', '2009-03-24 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5398004, 775675, 101678, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  Great composition, and very unique take on waterfalls.  The colors certainly speak for themselves.  10 from me.</td>', 'Fantastic.  Great composition, and very unique take on waterfalls.  The colors certainly speak for themselves.  10 from me.', '2009-03-24 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
