(5398197, 775021, 99506, '<td valign="top">My first thought was wow they must have been running but then I saw the title and yes I guess they would be running lol.<br/>Very nice use of the curves of the stairs coupled with the motion blur to give a great feel, shame about that notice board but nothing you could do about that eh</td>', 'My first thought was wow they must have been running but then I saw the title and yes I guess they would be running lol.Very nice use of the curves of the stairs coupled with the motion blur to give a great feel, shame about that notice board but nothing you could do about that eh', '2009-03-24 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5398198, 775007, 52472, '<td valign="top">At first the reflection feels wrong because of the interuption in the horizontal frozen band. But then it makes the picture very interesting, by adding depth along with the reeds. The flat lighting is a pity and keeps this from being outstanding.</td>', 'At first the reflection feels wrong because of the interuption in the horizontal frozen band. But then it makes the picture very interesting, by adding depth along with the reeds. The flat lighting is a pity and keeps this from being outstanding.', '2009-03-24 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5398199, 775250, 99506, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, and the lad has done a sterling job with his radid change of position with no noticable body movement.</td>', 'Very good idea, and the lad has done a sterling job with his radid change of position with no noticable body movement.', '2009-03-24 13:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5398201, 774846, 99506, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, I am instantly struck by the feeling of speed here, great work 9</td>', 'Brilliant, I am instantly struck by the feeling of speed here, great work 9', '2009-03-24 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
