(5398268, 775416, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s not far from a truly great shot, but my feeling is that you wanted too many things here. The river shore is a great element of composition, but not at its best in this lighting. The car trails on the other hand are great in this light, but lose impact due to the distance.</td>', 'It''s not far from a truly great shot, but my feeling is that you wanted too many things here. The river shore is a great element of composition, but not at its best in this lighting. The car trails on the other hand are great in this light, but lose impact due to the distance.', '2009-03-24 14:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
