(5401275, 775583, 81362, '<td valign="top">A bit ugly at first glance, but then becomes more dramatic and interesting. I hope you survived the situation intact.</td>', 'A bit ugly at first glance, but then becomes more dramatic and interesting. I hope you survived the situation intact.', '2009-03-25 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401282, 775665, 81362, '<td valign="top">Just like the cartoon characters. With the streaks appearing so sharp, I find that I don''t mind the background blur.</td>', 'Just like the cartoon characters. With the streaks appearing so sharp, I find that I don''t mind the background blur.', '2009-03-25 22:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401288, 774992, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very good crappy photograph, which is one of my favorite things.  Sometimes when a photograph seems to be about nothing much at all, and is certainly not about ''photography'' for its own sake, it attains a kind of vernacular distinction and even dignity.  This is one of those.  I like it.  7.</td>', 'A very good crappy photograph, which is one of my favorite things.  Sometimes when a photograph seems to be about nothing much at all, and is certainly not about ''photography'' for its own sake, it attains a kind of vernacular distinction and even dignity.  This is one of those.  I like it.  7.', '2009-03-25 22:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401291, 775418, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this at any shutter speed; dude looks like a nice guy.  Holds still pretty good, too.  Nice photo.  7.</td>', 'I like this at any shutter speed; dude looks like a nice guy.  Holds still pretty good, too.  Nice photo.  7.', '2009-03-25 22:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401308, 775687, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s odd ... a selective desat that I don''t mind at all.  It''s interesting to ponder the question of whether my reaction to it would be similar if the people were desaturated instead of the environment.  Would it still seem to be about the people then?  Or would it be about the city?  I don''t know for sure.  That''s why I like it.  7.</td>', 'That''s odd ... a selective desat that I don''t mind at all.  It''s interesting to ponder the question of whether my reaction to it would be similar if the people were desaturated instead of the environment.  Would it still seem to be about the people then?  Or would it be about the city?  I don''t know for sure.  That''s why I like it.  7.', '2009-03-25 22:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401313, 775082, 30364, '<td valign="top">I thought it was a fire at first.  I suppose everyone did.  It''s interestingly weird, or weirdly interesting.  I like it.</td>', 'I thought it was a fire at first.  I suppose everyone did.  It''s interestingly weird, or weirdly interesting.  I like it.', '2009-03-25 22:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401317, 775552, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes, the movement is translated into low frequency vibrations.  So it''s apt and very enjoyable.  7.</td>', 'Yes, the movement is translated into low frequency vibrations.  So it''s apt and very enjoyable.  7.', '2009-03-25 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401336, 774687, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wish the kitty was looking up. Hope he had fun though!</td>', 'Wish the kitty was looking up. Hope he had fun though!', '2009-03-25 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
