(5401403, 775415, 42495, '<td valign="top">Not sure about pointless, but I very much like the lighting and composition on this.  The petals form some nice contrasty stairs for my eyes to walk up.</td>', 'Not sure about pointless, but I very much like the lighting and composition on this.  The petals form some nice contrasty stairs for my eyes to walk up.', '2009-03-25 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401405, 775309, 30364, '<td valign="top">Much better than all the waterfalls; it makes me think outside the frame.  Where''s the water coming from?  Why is there a spout and not a spillway?  All that stuff.  I like it.</td>', 'Much better than all the waterfalls; it makes me think outside the frame.  Where''s the water coming from?  Why is there a spout and not a spillway?  All that stuff.  I like it.', '2009-03-25 23:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
