(5401418, 775691, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a very beautiful photograph, and yet if it were already the butterfly I probably wouldn''t give it a second glance.  I suppose it''s because it seems so harmonious this way; the caterpillar and the tree bark seem more comfortable with each other, while the adult butterfly would dominate the scene.  7.</td>', 'It''s a very beautiful photograph, and yet if it were already the butterfly I probably wouldn''t give it a second glance.  I suppose it''s because it seems so harmonious this way; the caterpillar and the tree bark seem more comfortable with each other, while the adult butterfly would dominate the scene.  7.', '2009-03-25 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401420, 775552, 42495, '<td valign="top">WOW - this is just awesome!<br/> <br/>Back for a real comment.  This is by far my fave of the challenge, it''s so full of motion and music and that processing makes it seem like a dreamy painting.  New fave.</td>', 'WOW - this is just awesome! Back for a real comment.  This is by far my fave of the challenge, it''s so full of motion and music and that processing makes it seem like a dreamy painting.  New fave.', '2009-03-25 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
