(5401519, 775696, 4967, '<td valign="top">Incense? Always fun!</td>', 'Incense? Always fun!', '2009-03-26 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401581, 775259, 30364, '<td valign="top">Smokers.  Why do they always stand right at the door?  (I speak as a reformed smoker of course)<br/>Quick story:  One of Australia''s leading businessmen was showing a very distinguished European counterpart around Sydney''s central business district.  The visitor remarked they he was surprised at the number of prostitutes brazenly touting for business around the front of respectable office buildings in broad daylight.  Our guy had to explain that they were all actually secretaries and other office staff sneaking outside for a smoke.<br/> <br/>Your photograph is excellent.  There''s a very strange connection between the smoker and the wee person above the door.  Maybe it''s that they are about the same size., and dressed the same.  Whatever, I like it.  7.</td>', 'Smokers.  Why do they always stand right at the door?  (I speak as a reformed smoker of course)Quick story:  One of Australia''s leading businessmen was showing a very distinguished European counterpart around Sydney''s central business district.  The visitor remarked they he was surprised at the number of prostitutes brazenly touting for business around the front of respectable office buildings in broad daylight.  Our guy had to explain that they were all actually secretaries and other office staff sneaking outside for a smoke. Your photograph is excellent.  There''s a very strange connection between the smoker and the wee person above the door.  Maybe it''s that they are about the same size., and dressed the same.  Whatever, I like it.  7.', '2009-03-26 01:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401583, 775692, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I just love how it inhabits that tiny space between the explicit and the abstract; not quite either one, and yet both.  I''m a big fan of images that get at the essence of their subject, and I don''t care at all about the 1 second bit (this could actually be 1/100sec or 5 minutes).  So it''s an 8 from me.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I just love how it inhabits that tiny space between the explicit and the abstract; not quite either one, and yet both.  I''m a big fan of images that get at the essence of their subject, and I don''t care at all about the 1 second bit (this could actually be 1/100sec or 5 minutes).  So it''s an 8 from me.', '2009-03-26 02:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401584, 775015, 30364, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect to like any of the seascape or other water shots, but you proved me to be an ignorant fool.  This is excellent.  7.</td>', 'I didn''t expect to like any of the seascape or other water shots, but you proved me to be an ignorant fool.  This is excellent.  7.', '2009-03-26 02:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401585, 775308, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I don''t think it''s Museum Station in Sydney (although it''s a long, long time since I''ve been there, so it could be).  I''m a sucker for underground train shots.  They not only look great, they have a sound, and even a feel ... a great rush of air.  It always makes me think of a space station.  Super shot.  7.</td>', 'Nice.  I don''t think it''s Museum Station in Sydney (although it''s a long, long time since I''ve been there, so it could be).  I''m a sucker for underground train shots.  They not only look great, they have a sound, and even a feel ... a great rush of air.  It always makes me think of a space station.  Super shot.  7.', '2009-03-26 02:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401586, 775019, 30364, '<td valign="top">A difficult and demanding photograph.  I suppose it''s a zoom effect, and it''s a very good one.  I might be being unreasonably influenced by the terrific title, but this is surely at least a 7.</td>', 'A difficult and demanding photograph.  I suppose it''s a zoom effect, and it''s a very good one.  I might be being unreasonably influenced by the terrific title, but this is surely at least a 7.', '2009-03-26 02:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401587, 775713, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great beauty.  The flowers are made dancers in some wistful moment from a ballet.   7.</td>', 'Great beauty.  The flowers are made dancers in some wistful moment from a ballet.   7.', '2009-03-26 02:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401589, 775424, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good out of the box. U might not get the masses approval, though.</td>', 'Good out of the box. U might not get the masses approval, though.', '2009-03-26 02:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401590, 774510, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s wonderful!  The impression of the great pressure and distortion of the water over the rocks is terrific.  It feels like this powerful image is just barely contained within the frame.  It''s not an abstract, and yet it is.  It''s literal, and yet it''s also figurative.  I just love that double identity.  8.</td>', 'That''s wonderful!  The impression of the great pressure and distortion of the water over the rocks is terrific.  It feels like this powerful image is just barely contained within the frame.  It''s not an abstract, and yet it is.  It''s literal, and yet it''s also figurative.  I just love that double identity.  8.', '2009-03-26 02:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
