(5403353, 775360, 26001, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea. <br/>i guess, two flashes on two sides of the face...fired one after another during the exposure. obviously the kid needs to be looking towards the flash (that must have hurt :P) when it fires. i like this.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea. i guess, two flashes on two sides of the face...fired one after another during the exposure. obviously the kid needs to be looking towards the flash (that must have hurt :P) when it fires. i like this.', '2009-03-27 01:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403416, 775702, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great sensual photograph.  It looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a> photograph, and that''s as good a compliment as I can offer.  8.</td>', 'Great sensual photograph.  It looks like a  nixter photograph, and that''s as good a compliment as I can offer.  8.', '2009-03-27 05:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403428, 775717, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a bold photograph.  Sideways orientation makes it initially harder to recognize, but then as the viewer grows more comfortable it seems to become more reflective, which is just right for the sentiment in the title.  Like transport to another place and time.  I am a big fan of ambiguity and uncertainty, because it seems to oblige the viewer to make some effort.  To meet you half way.  The hints of scrappy flowers are both disguise and motivation in this photograph.  So, all in all,  I like it very much.  9.</td>', 'It''s a bold photograph.  Sideways orientation makes it initially harder to recognize, but then as the viewer grows more comfortable it seems to become more reflective, which is just right for the sentiment in the title.  Like transport to another place and time.  I am a big fan of ambiguity and uncertainty, because it seems to oblige the viewer to make some effort.  To meet you half way.  The hints of scrappy flowers are both disguise and motivation in this photograph.  So, all in all,  I like it very much.  9.', '2009-03-27 05:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403429, 775209, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s perfectly believable as a glimpse of sci-fi servitude.  The atmosphere seems extraterrestrial.  I like photographs that transport me (as long as it''s not a life sentence).  8.</td>', 'It''s perfectly believable as a glimpse of sci-fi servitude.  The atmosphere seems extraterrestrial.  I like photographs that transport me (as long as it''s not a life sentence).  8.', '2009-03-27 05:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403433, 775431, 30364, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Such a grand room with no convincing signs of long-term occupancy.  As if the guy is just a transient user who''ll soon be gone and only the picture and the desk will remain.  Someone else will pinch the good chair as soon as he''s gone.  The ambiguous presence established by the exposure &amp; movement seems quite apt.  He''s there, but don''t blink.  9.</td>', 'Excellent!  Such a grand room with no convincing signs of long-term occupancy.  As if the guy is just a transient user who''ll soon be gone and only the picture and the desk will remain.  Someone else will pinch the good chair as soon as he''s gone.  The ambiguous presence established by the exposure & movement seems quite apt.  He''s there, but don''t blink.  9.', '2009-03-27 05:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403439, 775302, 91975, '<td valign="top">nice composistion and colour, a little heave with a lot of objects, but i like it 8</td>', 'nice composistion and colour, a little heave with a lot of objects, but i like it 8', '2009-03-27 06:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403441, 775120, 91975, '<td valign="top">piece of art 10</td>', 'piece of art 10', '2009-03-27 06:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403448, 774524, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph, probably because it has a strange Space Station feel to it.  Isolated by the darkness, I guess.  I''ve tried a few similar night-time shots myself, and never managed this kind of superb result.  8.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph, probably because it has a strange Space Station feel to it.  Isolated by the darkness, I guess.  I''ve tried a few similar night-time shots myself, and never managed this kind of superb result.  8.', '2009-03-27 06:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403451, 775712, 30364, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition that exploits the extended exposure in a subtle and thoughtful way.  The title is well chosen for the effect.  9.</td>', 'A lovely composition that exploits the extended exposure in a subtle and thoughtful way.  The title is well chosen for the effect.  9.', '2009-03-27 06:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403452, 775669, 91975, '<td valign="top">like it 9</td>', 'like it 9', '2009-03-27 06:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403456, 775521, 91975, '<td valign="top">wierd colours...5</td>', 'wierd colours...5', '2009-03-27 06:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403460, 775308, 91975, '<td valign="top">cliche...</td>', 'cliche...', '2009-03-27 06:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403461, 775669, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is just wonderful.  A brilliant <i>ragoût</i> of certainty and uncertainty; the explicit and implicit; tone, texture and graphic grace.  And I use the culinary allusion advisedly, because this image has all the balance and inspired fusion of a modern-classic dish.  Undertones and overtones in absolute harmony.  And it''s also a perfect natural diptych, just for a bonus (and presumably to prompt some dismal soul to request validation ... Bah!).<br/> <br/>I''d give it a 12 if that score were available.  Alas, 10''s my limit.  Plus the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is just wonderful.  A brilliant ragoût of certainty and uncertainty; the explicit and implicit; tone, texture and graphic grace.  And I use the culinary allusion advisedly, because this image has all the balance and inspired fusion of a modern-classic dish.  Undertones and overtones in absolute harmony.  And it''s also a perfect natural diptych, just for a bonus (and presumably to prompt some dismal soul to request validation ... Bah!). I''d give it a 12 if that score were available.  Alas, 10''s my limit.  Plus the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-03-27 06:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403471, 774870, 8759, '<td valign="top">While technically very well executed it remains (for me) a very flat image. 6<br/>Border does not improve IMO Good Luck</td>', 'While technically very well executed it remains (for me) a very flat image. 6Border does not improve IMO Good Luck', '2009-03-27 06:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403473, 775082, 8759, '<td valign="top">Very appealing B&amp;W. Good tones and details. On the negative it looks tilted a bit for me and the left down corner could have had more details. Very nice 9</td>', 'Very appealing B&W. Good tones and details. On the negative it looks tilted a bit for me and the left down corner could have had more details. Very nice 9', '2009-03-27 06:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403475, 774062, 8759, '<td valign="top">The fact that all are blurred does not help much. Would have been great if one of the subjects was still and look sharp. Good luck</td>', 'The fact that all are blurred does not help much. Would have been great if one of the subjects was still and look sharp. Good luck', '2009-03-27 06:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403479, 775360, 8759, '<td valign="top">While the set up and colours are great I find the image a bit disturbing and pointless. Otherwise it meets the challenge and is very well executed... 6 for these reasons</td>', 'While the set up and colours are great I find the image a bit disturbing and pointless. Otherwise it meets the challenge and is very well executed... 6 for these reasons', '2009-03-27 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403480, 775648, 8759, '<td valign="top">The concept is good but the fact that all the image is blurred ruins it. Also very noisy, lacking contrast. 4</td>', 'The concept is good but the fact that all the image is blurred ruins it. Also very noisy, lacking contrast. 4', '2009-03-27 06:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403482, 775669, 8759, '<td valign="top">Looks very appealing and interesting. I am not sure what filters you used (legal?) but would not affect the vote. 8</td>', 'Looks very appealing and interesting. I am not sure what filters you used (legal?) but would not affect the vote. 8', '2009-03-27 06:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403485, 774687, 8759, '<td valign="top">Did he enjoyed? Interesting concept. Too much on the chair in the picture but i guess was hard not to. Also focus seems to be sharper on the chair detracting the view from Euclid. Good luck 6</td>', 'Did he enjoyed? Interesting concept. Too much on the chair in the picture but i guess was hard not to. Also focus seems to be sharper on the chair detracting the view from Euclid. Good luck 6', '2009-03-27 06:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403487, 774884, 8759, '<td valign="top">Cute sweet indeed. Very well executed. Does it say 1 sec in a way? No Good luck 5</td>', 'Cute sweet indeed. Very well executed. Does it say 1 sec in a way? No Good luck 5', '2009-03-27 06:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403488, 775072, 8759, '<td valign="top">Does it say 1 sec in a way? No. Apart from that I find the foreground stealing the view. Also appears that you used flash or some harsh lighting that reflects on the skin of the lemon.</td>', 'Does it say 1 sec in a way? No. Apart from that I find the foreground stealing the view. Also appears that you used flash or some harsh lighting that reflects on the skin of the lemon.', '2009-03-27 06:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403495, 775696, 93565, '<td valign="top">This looks a tad grainy but I really enjoy the fluidity of all the curves. The twisting purple against the black backdrop is really pretty neat.</td>', 'This looks a tad grainy but I really enjoy the fluidity of all the curves. The twisting purple against the black backdrop is really pretty neat.', '2009-03-27 06:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403497, 775015, 8759, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more interesting without the sky and sun. Eventually on a square crop. Interesting subject and good execution. Good luck 6</td>', 'I think it would have been more interesting without the sky and sun. Eventually on a square crop. Interesting subject and good execution. Good luck 6', '2009-03-27 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403517, 775704, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this- specifically the line of the wind generators, which leads to the base of the mountain, which draws your eyes back up to the top of the image. Maybe a little higher contrast, but I like it the way it is too.</td>', 'I like the composition of this- specifically the line of the wind generators, which leads to the base of the mountain, which draws your eyes back up to the top of the image. Maybe a little higher contrast, but I like it the way it is too.', '2009-03-27 07:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403531, 774463, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the semi-transparent border- it''s a bit distracting.<br/>Also, and yours is certainly not the only one, but using a one second exposure has added nothing to the actual photo for me. In my mind I''m not requiring movement, and the fact that it was a one second exposure doesn''t need to be drilled home, but simply taking a photo and lowering your iso/stopping down to achieve a 1 sec exposure seems slightly shoehornish. Perhaps you are illustrating how lazy cats are. And now I''m rambling. Back on track- the scene seems a bit cluttered and undecided...there are clothes in the background, a psychadelic 70''s chair that demands attention, a giant fur pelt, and a cat staring you in the eye, all vying for the viewer''s focus.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the semi-transparent border- it''s a bit distracting.Also, and yours is certainly not the only one, but using a one second exposure has added nothing to the actual photo for me. In my mind I''m not requiring movement, and the fact that it was a one second exposure doesn''t need to be drilled home, but simply taking a photo and lowering your iso/stopping down to achieve a 1 sec exposure seems slightly shoehornish. Perhaps you are illustrating how lazy cats are. And now I''m rambling. Back on track- the scene seems a bit cluttered and undecided...there are clothes in the background, a psychadelic 70''s chair that demands attention, a giant fur pelt, and a cat staring you in the eye, all vying for the viewer''s focus.', '2009-03-27 07:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403532, 774510, 93565, '<td valign="top">If I were you I surely would have had a hard time deciding to place this photo in the 1 sec exposure challenge vs. the abstract motion. The lines are so smooth it almost looks like a painting. Nice variety of hues in the water, as well.</td>', 'If I were you I surely would have had a hard time deciding to place this photo in the 1 sec exposure challenge vs. the abstract motion. The lines are so smooth it almost looks like a painting. Nice variety of hues in the water, as well.', '2009-03-27 07:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403536, 775301, 93565, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit garish, and could use some softening.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit garish, and could use some softening.', '2009-03-27 07:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403537, 775103, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this quite a bit more if it weren''t processed quite so heavily.</td>', 'I think I''d like this quite a bit more if it weren''t processed quite so heavily.', '2009-03-27 07:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403538, 775596, 93565, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha. Maybe there was some credence to the thread about matches becoming the next water drop.<br/>Those burned matchheads have a pretty interesting texture, somewhat akin to furry brains, whatever that means.<br/>The question, of course, is whether the single match remaining was purposeful or serendipitous.</td>', 'Hahahaha. Maybe there was some credence to the thread about matches becoming the next water drop.Those burned matchheads have a pretty interesting texture, somewhat akin to furry brains, whatever that means.The question, of course, is whether the single match remaining was purposeful or serendipitous.', '2009-03-27 07:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403586, 774794, 30364, '<td valign="top">It seems to be an exposure of 50 years as much as it does of 1 second.  I especially admire the fact that the movement blur is so subtle, and yet so appropriate to the essence of the subject. A tremendously thoughtful and original photograph with several levels of reward for the viewer prepared to make the effort.  10.  And the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It seems to be an exposure of 50 years as much as it does of 1 second.  I especially admire the fact that the movement blur is so subtle, and yet so appropriate to the essence of the subject. A tremendously thoughtful and original photograph with several levels of reward for the viewer prepared to make the effort.  10.  And the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-03-27 08:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403727, 774510, 104437, '<td valign="top">Amazing look</td>', 'Amazing look', '2009-03-27 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403899, 775426, 54885, '<td valign="top">I really love this-the colors are perfect-the moon is clear(which is hard to accomplish)This is a definite 10 for me.</td>', 'I really love this-the colors are perfect-the moon is clear(which is hard to accomplish)This is a definite 10 for me.', '2009-03-27 12:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403901, 775318, 54885, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and colors-perfect blend of blur</td>', 'excellent lighting and colors-perfect blend of blur', '2009-03-27 12:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403902, 775660, 54885, '<td valign="top">pretty setting</td>', 'pretty setting', '2009-03-27 12:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403907, 775717, 54885, '<td valign="top">this is very out of focus</td>', 'this is very out of focus', '2009-03-27 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403986, 775007, 8054, '<td valign="top">Something about the color seems odd. At first it looks like it might be sepia but then I see traces of red/orange along the shoreline. Is it really this color?</td>', 'Something about the color seems odd. At first it looks like it might be sepia but then I see traces of red/orange along the shoreline. Is it really this color?', '2009-03-27 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403988, 775308, 8054, '<td valign="top">Which direction was the train moving? I''m guessing away and you used 2nd curtain sync but you never know!  :) Great shot.</td>', 'Which direction was the train moving? I''m guessing away and you used 2nd curtain sync but you never know!  :) Great shot.', '2009-03-27 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403991, 775418, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture you have here! Color looks very nice and lighting is great.</td>', 'Very nice capture you have here! Color looks very nice and lighting is great.', '2009-03-27 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403992, 775539, 8054, '<td valign="top">Pretty amusing photo!</td>', 'Pretty amusing photo!', '2009-03-27 14:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403993, 775659, 8054, '<td valign="top">The four spotlights are distracting.</td>', 'The four spotlights are distracting.', '2009-03-27 14:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403994, 774728, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting desat with the eyes. Draws the viewer into the photo more.</td>', 'Interesting desat with the eyes. Draws the viewer into the photo more.', '2009-03-27 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403998, 775687, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice desat! The color of the people seems to give them a harried sense.</td>', 'Very nice desat! The color of the people seems to give them a harried sense.', '2009-03-27 14:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403999, 775603, 8054, '<td valign="top">Difficult to discern what the object is. Car? Motorcycle?</td>', 'Difficult to discern what the object is. Car? Motorcycle?', '2009-03-27 14:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404001, 774846, 8054, '<td valign="top">HAHA this is great! How did you mount the camera to the car?</td>', 'HAHA this is great! How did you mount the camera to the car?', '2009-03-27 14:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404005, 775648, 8054, '<td valign="top">Where''s the focal point? I would expect the train to be blurred but the whole image?</td>', 'Where''s the focal point? I would expect the train to be blurred but the whole image?', '2009-03-27 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404008, 774453, 8054, '<td valign="top">Cool, a slot car! Hardly thought these were still around these days.</td>', 'Cool, a slot car! Hardly thought these were still around these days.', '2009-03-27 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404011, 775360, 8054, '<td valign="top">Yikes, this one is just creepy! Can she really do that with her eyes?!</td>', 'Yikes, this one is just creepy! Can she really do that with her eyes?!', '2009-03-27 15:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404013, 775607, 8054, '<td valign="top">Is this Niagara Falls?</td>', 'Is this Niagara Falls?', '2009-03-27 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404069, 775532, 52500, '<td valign="top">I think I''d actually like this better without the person.  It''s beautiful, nonetheless.  I imagine it will score pretty well, too.  Might this be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a> image?</td>', 'I think I''d actually like this better without the person.  It''s beautiful, nonetheless.  I imagine it will score pretty well, too.  Might this be a  Judi image?', '2009-03-27 16:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404070, 775717, 52500, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...really dark and blurry...could it be a pinhole or zoneplate shot?</td>', 'Hmmmm...really dark and blurry...could it be a pinhole or zoneplate shot?', '2009-03-27 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404071, 775583, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s just fantastic.  Great title, too.</td>', 'That''s just fantastic.  Great title, too.', '2009-03-27 16:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404074, 775648, 52500, '<td valign="top">With those super sharp sensor dust specs this has got to be a pinhole shot.  I kinda like it!</td>', 'With those super sharp sensor dust specs this has got to be a pinhole shot.  I kinda like it!', '2009-03-27 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404076, 775539, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s some good work to get 3 of ''im in 1 second with practically no overlap!  Unfortunately, the end result is not very pleasing to the eyes.</td>', 'That''s some good work to get 3 of ''im in 1 second with practically no overlap!  Unfortunately, the end result is not very pleasing to the eyes.', '2009-03-27 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404077, 775287, 52500, '<td valign="top">Perfect application of the 1 second.  I love the way the streaking rain looks like scratches on glass.</td>', 'Perfect application of the 1 second.  I love the way the streaking rain looks like scratches on glass.', '2009-03-27 16:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404322, 775301, 101256, '<td valign="top">They aren''t bison - they are oxen.</td>', 'They aren''t bison - they are oxen.', '2009-03-27 19:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404408, 775532, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  One of my favorites of the challenge.  Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'Beautiful.  One of my favorites of the challenge.  Back to bump you up to 9.', '2009-03-27 20:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404411, 775205, 55838, '<td valign="top">Nice light and I like the contrast.  Interesting.  One of my 8''s.</td>', 'Nice light and I like the contrast.  Interesting.  One of my 8''s.', '2009-03-27 20:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404412, 774510, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely motion and drama.</td>', 'Lovely motion and drama.', '2009-03-27 20:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404423, 775205, 12076, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Hat looks familiar.  Interesting that my eyes continue to move from the light switch to the partial picture frame to the glasses to the watch to the light switch....   Clockwise around a blank center.  Great sharpness for a second.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Hmm.  Hat looks familiar.  Interesting that my eyes continue to move from the light switch to the partial picture frame to the glasses to the watch to the light switch....   Clockwise around a blank center.  Great sharpness for a second.  I like this a lot.', '2009-03-27 20:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404425, 775418, 12076, '<td valign="top">Excellent, tight portrait.  Great sharpness for a second.</td>', 'Excellent, tight portrait.  Great sharpness for a second.', '2009-03-27 20:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404669, 775106, 101445, '<td valign="top">I find this interesting, although I don''t get the connection to the title</td>', 'I find this interesting, although I don''t get the connection to the title', '2009-03-27 23:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404675, 774396, 101445, '<td valign="top">the door in the background is a little distracting</td>', 'the door in the background is a little distracting', '2009-03-27 23:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404763, 775278, 77192, '<td valign="top">Delightful. Love the colour of the sky</td>', 'Delightful. Love the colour of the sky', '2009-03-28 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404764, 774687, 77192, '<td valign="top">definitely original, I''ll give you that.<br/> <br/>minus a point for animal cruelty ;-)</td>', 'definitely original, I''ll give you that. minus a point for animal cruelty ;-)', '2009-03-28 04:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
