(5404767, 775164, 77192, '<td valign="top"><strike>the sky looks a bit overly tonemapped for me</strike> actually on second thought I think it''s about right. Excellent shot.</td>', 'the sky looks a bit overly tonemapped for me actually on second thought I think it''s about right. Excellent shot.', '2009-03-28 04:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
