(5406846, 775544, 62249, '<td valign="top">Except for the garish yellow border, I like this a lot. Might like the border better if it were more orange and thinner. I like the fish shape and the delicate ribs of the fin on the left of the shot.</td>', 'Except for the garish yellow border, I like this a lot. Might like the border better if it were more orange and thinner. I like the fish shape and the delicate ribs of the fin on the left of the shot.', '2009-03-29 18:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
