(5408095, 775533, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your commenters like the processing, those who gave it 4 and below did not.  And if it were me, I''d have the bottom two thirds be the reflection and the top limited to the dock and just a bit of the actual trees/shoreline, since the reflection is what the 1-second exposure is kind of "highlighting" so to speak.  Make sense?</td>', 'Your commenters like the processing, those who gave it 4 and below did not.  And if it were me, I''d have the bottom two thirds be the reflection and the top limited to the dock and just a bit of the actual trees/shoreline, since the reflection is what the 1-second exposure is kind of "highlighting" so to speak.  Make sense?', '2009-03-30 10:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
