(5408190, 774992, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> A very good crappy photograph, which is one of my favorite things.  Sometimes when a photograph seems to be about nothing much at all, and is certainly not about ''photography'' for its own sake, it attains a kind of vernacular distinction and even dignity.  This is one of those.  I like it.  7. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yeah, that''s what I meant. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: A very good crappy photograph, which is one of my favorite things.  Sometimes when a photograph seems to be about nothing much at all, and is certainly not about ''photography'' for its own sake, it attains a kind of vernacular distinction and even dignity.  This is one of those.  I like it.  7.   yeah, that''s what I meant. :)', '2009-03-30 12:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
