(5408807, 775205, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Heh!  I was wondering if this was you.  You''re a handsome fellow - Mrs. Ubique done good when she caught you.  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ha!  I showed her this comment.  Unfortunately she was drinking tea at the time so I got a bit wet.  When she''d recovered enough to speak, she gasped, "ROFLMAO" (whatever that means).</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Heh!  I was wondering if this was you.  You''re a handsome fellow - Mrs. Ubique done good when she caught you.  :-)  Ha!  I showed her this comment.  Unfortunately she was drinking tea at the time so I got a bit wet.  When she''d recovered enough to speak, she gasped, "ROFLMAO" (whatever that means).', '2009-03-30 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
