(5409358, 775717, 77196, '<td valign="top">Alas, a victim of the two second vote - blurry, grainy shot. 3. next. <br/>This is an absolutely awesome shot. I truly did not get it either, until I read the comment about the face. Face? What face? After about 30 seconds, it dawned on me - oh - *that* face! The different orientation for the face adds to the time required for recognition (at least for me). Wonderful blending of tones in flowers with skin color. I also think the uncalibrated monitors out there hurt you too (mine included).</td>', 'Alas, a victim of the two second vote - blurry, grainy shot. 3. next. This is an absolutely awesome shot. I truly did not get it either, until I read the comment about the face. Face? What face? After about 30 seconds, it dawned on me - oh - *that* face! The different orientation for the face adds to the time required for recognition (at least for me). Wonderful blending of tones in flowers with skin color. I also think the uncalibrated monitors out there hurt you too (mine included).', '2009-03-30 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
